  'dpwi-seeks-investors-pretoria-cbd-precinct-2026-10-08',
  'Government seeks investors for R4.5bn Pretoria CBD precinct revamp',
  'Business', '2026-10-08', 'Rekord', 'https://www.citizen.co.za/rekord/news-headlines/2026/10/08/department-of-public-works-seeks-market-input-for-r4-5b-tshwane-inner-city-precinct-redevelopment/',
  'The Department of Public Works wants private investors'' input on redeveloping three vacant government buildings in Pretoria''s CBD, including Telkom Towers.',
  'The national Department of Public Works and Infrastructure has asked the private sector for input on redeveloping three vacant, government-owned office blocks in the capital: the nine-building Telkom Towers complex, plus the separate Public Works House and Central Government Offices buildings nearby. The department is hoping the project will draw R4.5 billion in private investment to bring the sites back into use.

Through a published request for information, companies are being asked to weigh in on how the buildings could be fixed up and run, including a model in which a private partner refurbishes and operates the properties for a period before handing them back to the state. Industry estimates put the cost of refurbishing the nine Telkom Towers buildings alone at between R1.8 billion and R2.2 billion, which would create roughly 106,000 square metres of leasable office space.

Once finished, the precinct is intended to house government departments based in the City of Tshwane. Public Works Minister Dean Macpherson described the request for information as a key milestone for reviving the Telkom Towers site, and said the exercise will help the department work out which upgrade options make engineering sense, which ones investors would actually pay for, and which the state could afford to keep running, before it moves on to the next stage of the process.',
  NULL, NULL, NULL,
  '["https://www.citizen.co.za/rekord/news-headlines/2026/10/08/department-of-public-works-seeks-market-input-for-r4-5b-tshwane-inner-city-precinct-redevelopment/", "https://www.infrapppworld.com/update/south-africas-dpwi-seeks-market-input-for-zar22-billion-telkom-towers-redevelopment-in-pretoria"]',
  'agent'
);
